    https://bugs.python.org/issue13831.

    This decorator wraps rio-mucho worker tasks.

    Parameters
    ----------
    func : function
        A function to be decorated.

    Returns
    -------
    func"""
    @wraps(func)
    def wrapper(*args, **kwds):
        try:
            return func(*args, **kwds)
        except Exception:
            raise MuchoChildError()
    return wrapper

