    xlim : None | 'auto' | (xmin, xmax)
        'auto' : sets the limits according to the most
        extreme values of data encountered.
    ylim : None | 'auto' | (ymin, ymax)"""
    auto_axis = ''
    if xlim == 'auto':
        auto_axis += 'x'
    if ylim == 'auto':
        auto_axis += 'y'
