    :param identifier: An id of the entry to fetch, in the BibTeX file.
    :param ignore_fields: An optional list of fields to strip from the BibTeX             file.

    :returns: A ``bibtexparser.BibDatabase`` object representing the             fetched entry. ``None`` if entry was not found."""
